#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:7
#: 076e0f1b078c406589487bc926493524
msgid "ViewPro Gimbals"
msgstr "ViewPro 云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:12
#: 76e85831d9434673a964aec03825d15b
msgid ""
"ArduPilot 4.4 (and higher) support the `ViewPro "
"<http://www.viewprotech.com/index.php?ac=article&at=list&tid=127>`__ gimbals"
" using ViewPro's custom serial protocol."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 4.4（及更高版本）支持使用 ViewPro 自定义串口协议的 `ViewPro "
"<http://www.viewprotech.com/index.php?ac=article&at=list&tid=127>`__ 云台。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:15
#: 30c64c08210646f9a80296894ba63766
msgid "Connection and Configuration"
msgstr "连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:17
#: 48f32cc3639c4b34bedfc0a7014d7ff5
msgid ""
"Connect one of the autopilot's serial ports to the gimbal as shown below.  "
"The first image if for users with a \"viewport\" connection."
msgstr "将飞控的一个串口连接至云台，如下图所示。第一张图适用于使用「viewport」连接的用户。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:27
#: 309989f7d25a4178aab6632905eba9d7
msgid "If using 4.5.x (or higher):"
msgstr "如使用 4.5.x（或更高版本）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:29
#: e1fcd70e9f4d4543bce3c818ab63cf09
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 8 (Gimbal).  This assumes "
"the gimbal is attached to the autopilot's Serial2 port but any serial port "
"can be used."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 8（Gimbal）。此处假设云台连接到飞控 "
"Serial2 端口，但任意串口均可使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:30
#: 65cf5672ff334160bfab655c1554540a
msgid "Set :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:31
#: 5296c0195e3a421d83b0ef372adcbe1c
msgid "Set :ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` = 11 (Viewpro)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` = 11（Viewpro）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:32
#: 70a6c6de30234e25892adcc6fea22318
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAM1_TYPE<CAM1_TYPE>` = 4 (Mount) to enable the camera control "
"using the mount driver"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`CAM1_TYPE<CAM1_TYPE>` = 4（Mount），以使用挂载驱动进行相机控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:33
#: 63d8cf173cb947de8b2702bc9c17df59
msgid ""
":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 213 (\"Mount Pitch\") to control the "
"gimbal's pitch angle with RC channel 6"
msgstr ":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 213（「Mount Pitch」），用 RC 通道 6 控制云台俯仰角"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:34
#: 8a2b7a7e0edf4e77838a613e2dc398de
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 214 (\"Mount Yaw\") to control the gimbal's"
" yaw angle with RC channel 7"
msgstr ":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 214（「Mount Yaw」），用 RC 通道 7 控制云台偏航角"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:36
#: 6e1dd148088e4acebcd738e5bce2f6bf
msgid "Optionally these auxiliary functions are also available"
msgstr "以下辅助功能也可选配"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:38
#: 6ffa3b92954a459d95b5814411edd0f8
msgid ""
":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 166 (\"Camera Record Video\") to start/stop"
" recording of video"
msgstr ":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 166（「Camera Record Video」），用于开始/停止录像"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:39
#: f4c37762acdf40c58aad82dd46d43972
msgid ""
":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 168 (\"Camera Manual Focus\") to adjust "
"focus in and out"
msgstr ":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 168（「Camera Manual Focus」），用于手动调焦"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:40
#: a63259316a5245d38c626537dbc01345
msgid ""
":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 169 (\"Camera Auto Focus\") to trigger auto"
" focus"
msgstr ":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 169（「Camera Auto Focus」），用于触发自动对焦"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:41
#: d56e83c5cfbd4915a74d8e8d19832cb2
msgid ""
":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 174 (\"Camera Image Tracking\") to track "
"what is in the center of the image"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 174（「Camera Image Tracking」），用于跟踪图像中心内容"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:42
#: e03ca032f87945f09805c4cb2d8c809a
msgid ""
":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 175 (\"Camera Lens\") to select which video"
" stream is sent to the GCS"
msgstr ":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 175（「Camera Lens」），用于选择发送至地面站的视频流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:44
#: 0a697095684445888864e14f24bede6e
msgid "If using 4.4.x:"
msgstr "如使用 4.4.x："

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:46
#: 7f57275c286e4dc58d594e2ef1cb5a92
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 28 (Scripting).  This "
"assumes the gimbal is attached to the autopilot's Serial2 port but any "
"serial port can be used."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 28（Scripting）。此处假设云台连接到飞控 "
"Serial2 端口，但任意串口均可使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:47
#: 33dd987d14764987a8fda5b6eaebb298
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SCR_ENABLE <SCR_ENABLE>` = 1 to enable scripting and reboot the "
"autopilot"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`SCR_ENABLE <SCR_ENABLE>` = 1 以启用脚本功能，并重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:48
#: 3e9a6d4881274646aeb4c4c80d4a18f7
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` = 9 (Scripting) to enable the mount/gimbal "
"scripting driver"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` = 9（Scripting），以启用挂载/云台脚本驱动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:49
#: ad8ac6b7cd194183a83fbd4385f0c891
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAM1_TYPE<CAM1_TYPE>` = 4 (Mount) to enable the camera1 instance "
"control using the mount driver"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`CAM1_TYPE<CAM1_TYPE>` = 4（Mount），以使用挂载驱动控制 camera1 实例"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:50
#: 9ea05e5b49e147278def95ac010b43bc
msgid ""
"`Download mount-viewpro-driver.lua from here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/Copter-4.4/libraries/AP_Scripting/drivers>`__"
" and copy it to the autopilot's SD card in the APM/scripts directory and "
"reboot the autopilot"
msgstr ""
"`从此处下载 mount-viewpro-driver.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/Copter-4.4/libraries/AP_Scripting/drivers>`__，将其复制到飞控"
" SD 卡的 APM/scripts 目录中，然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:51
#: 4461c56f245d4f048dd668dabb9beca1
msgid ""
"Optionally for gimbals with multiple cameras, an auxiliary switch can "
"control the active camera by doing the following"
msgstr "对于配备多个相机的云台，可选配辅助开关以控制活动相机，操作如下"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:53
#: f63f514844b04a06917f1d84d02d219c
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 300 (Scripting1) to allow selecting the"
" active camera with RC9.  Note that any auxiliary switch may be used."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 300（Scripting1），以允许通过 RC9 "
"选择活动相机。可使用任意辅助开关。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:54
#: 9948ffec5ef7425e93c893c3673a9d8a
msgid ""
"When the driver script is run, it creates three new parameters : "
"VIEP_CAM_SWLOW, VIEP_CAM_SWMID, and VIEP_CAM_SWHIGH. These control the "
"active camera when the aux switch is the low, medium and high position "
"respectively.  Possible values are"
msgstr ""
"驱动脚本运行后将创建三个新参数：VIEP_CAM_SWLOW、VIEP_CAM_SWMID 和 "
"VIEP_CAM_SWHIGH，分别控制辅助开关在低位、中位和高位时的活动相机。可选值为"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:56
#: 4cf3b0aba3d449ebbe6f730085f2a394
msgid "0: No change in camera selection"
msgstr "0：不切换相机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:57
#: d7511dfbb0254791a4b61c5cd6e68c09
msgid "1: EO1"
msgstr "1：EO1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:58
#: 00b30a3bbd294b109bb985a6868f1134
msgid "2: IR thermal"
msgstr "2：IR 热成像"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:59
#: 34e697978c7947c59f5e57aaa18a0634
msgid "3: EO1 + IR Picture-in-picture"
msgstr "3：EO1 + IR 画中画"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:60
#: 5c3b16cb99c24f8ea107ac80ac135f72
msgid "4: IR + EO1 Picture-in-picture"
msgstr "4：IR + EO1 画中画"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:61
#: ac5de5700a664cc681be74cb55d77330
msgid "5: Fusion"
msgstr "5：融合"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:62
#: 9f3fdda5637c410c8fd553a14081b29a
msgid "6: IR1 13mm"
msgstr "6：IR1 13mm"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:63
#: 4fddd9445daf43bba3bc3748aa869c39
msgid "7: IR2 52mm"
msgstr "7：IR2 52mm"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:65
#: 8a6fcd7872d846989b5c4517e040c6c8
msgid ""
"Set VIEP_ZOOM_SPEED parameter created by the driver script to control the "
"speed of zoom (value between 0 and 7)"
msgstr "设置驱动脚本创建的 VIEP_ZOOM_SPEED 参数以控制变焦速度（取值 0 到 7）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:68
#: 08afa197faf541b9abd13ef49bcf5f34
msgid "Control and Testing"
msgstr "控制与测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:70
#: 1daaf646f1d14035b5904b83fb6bd494
msgid ""
"See :ref:`Gimbal / Mount Controls <common-mount-targeting>` and :ref:`Camera"
" Controls <common-camera-controls>` for details on how to control the gimbal"
" using RC, GCS or Auto mode mission commands"
msgstr ""
"参见 :ref:`云台/挂载控制 <common-mount-targeting>` 和 :ref:`相机控制 <common-camera-"
"controls>`，了解如何通过 RC、地面站或 Auto 模式任务指令控制云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:73
#: 3a46b66f58fa44c192674637466bc066
msgid "Rangerfinder Control"
msgstr "测距仪控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:75
#: 2a34954508864966bd50976b742c84c0
msgid ""
"Some versions of the ViewPro Gimbals have a rangefinder that displays range "
"in the OSD. This continuous ranging updating can be disabled using an RC "
"switch whose ``RCx_OPTIONS`` is set to \"177\"."
msgstr ""
"部分 ViewPro 云台型号内置测距仪，可在 OSD 中显示距离。可通过 ``RCx_OPTIONS`` 设置为「177」的 RC "
"开关禁用持续测距更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:78
#: b7da574090284203955c414cad577b44
msgid "Testing Video Streaming"
msgstr "视频流测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:80
#: e7f76d385c5d48438d1715f493038b63
msgid ""
"To test video streaming works using a Windows PC, connect the camera's "
"ethernet cable to your local router."
msgstr "如需在 Windows 电脑上测试视频流，请将相机的以太网线连接到本地路由器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:82
#: a829653961664c88935a00b4ea4ea11f
msgid "Download and install `VLC media player <https://www.videolan.org/>`__"
msgstr "下载并安装 `VLC 媒体播放器 <https://www.videolan.org/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:83
#: bed8add5bbd24f6cb5fd37af4d68dc6b
msgid "On the PC, open Settings, Network & Internet, Ethernet"
msgstr "在电脑上，打开「设置」>「网络和 Internet」>「以太网」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:84
#: d9330d6520ef412dbaf37a7614f31609
msgid ""
"Find the \"IP assignment\" section, click the \"Edit\" button and select "
"\"Manual\""
msgstr "找到「IP 分配」部分，点击「编辑」按钮并选择「手动」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:86
#: fa78308a3a854795b7e104985ea8ff36
msgid "Move the IPv4 slider to On"
msgstr "将 IPv4 滑块切换至「开」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:87
#: b9a7eeb8da424babb950f8666b0ebe95
msgid "IP address: 192.168.2.118"
msgstr "IP 地址：192.168.2.118"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:88
#: 8f2726b29c974bceab78e0615ea81401
msgid "Subnet mask: 255.255.255.0"
msgstr "子网掩码：255.255.255.0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:89
#: fb0aa2c7ca784adda39e189c1cf53f84
msgid "Gateway: 192.168.2.1"
msgstr "网关：192.168.2.1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:90
#: 2ce0e1595af34866b32993e8bb4f4214
msgid "Preferred DNS: 10.10.0.101"
msgstr "首选 DNS：10.10.0.101"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:91
#: ee9b4cc5383a4a348f62388519767c7f
msgid "Press \"Save\" (note you will likely lose your internet connection)"
msgstr "点击「保存」（注意此时可能会断开网络连接）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:93
#: ab0c829cb44740e1bce6ba8d264fdea3
msgid ""
"Open VLC media player, Select Media, Open Network Stream, Network and enter "
"\"rtsp://192.168.2.119:554\""
msgstr "打开 VLC 媒体播放器，选择「媒体」>「打开网络串流」>「网络」，输入「rtsp://192.168.2.119:554」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:94
#: e968190206e0418c9df6cd3d4d07ab4e
msgid ""
"Once completed testing, restore your internet by reverting the PC's \"IP "
"assignment\" to \"Automatic (DHCP)\""
msgstr "测试完成后，将电脑的「IP 分配」改回「自动（DHCP）」以恢复网络连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:96
#: fcc91f9184fe470ab3a955453977e31a
msgid "Video can also be streamed to QGroundControl"
msgstr "视频也可以推流至 QGroundControl"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:98
#: f5d55b26b01e4f0695e4d41d559e33f4
msgid ""
"Open a web browser and enter the URL, "
"\"http://192.168.2.119:8554/index.html\" to open the Viewpro System settings"
msgstr "打开浏览器，访问「http://192.168.2.119:8554/index.html」以打开 Viewpro 系统设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:99
#: 023e4d102a77430e894ddf695479c3a9
msgid "Change the \"Stream Type\" to \"h.265\" as shown below"
msgstr "将「Stream Type」改为「h.265」，如下图所示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:105
#: 014d4769cf354d20b82f8bcb1be28861
msgid ""
"Open QGC's Application Settings, General, and set Video Settings, Source to "
"RTSP Video Stream"
msgstr "打开 QGC 的「应用设置」>「常规」，在「视频设置」中将「来源」设置为「RTSP 视频流」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:106
#: eb4888d2a0284e5b8047ba71800e07df
msgid "Set RTSP URL to \"rtsp://192.168.2.119:554\" as shown below"
msgstr "将 RTSP URL 设置为「rtsp://192.168.2.119:554」，如下图所示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:112
#: 270a72e724724e5584180e63b1bad7a1
msgid ""
"If using Mission Planner, the live video can be displayed on the Data screen"
" by following :ref:`these instructions <planner:live-video>`"
msgstr "如使用 Mission Planner，可按照 :ref:`这些说明 <planner:live-video>` 在数据界面显示实时视频"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:115
#: 95452af4f86d442d9cd023eb5d3763ac
msgid "Downloading Images and Videos"
msgstr "下载图像和视频"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:117
#: 0bebb5b18f084722aaed5077b0248abe
msgid ""
"If the gimbal is connected using Ethernet, images and videos stored on the "
"SD card may be downloaded manually using the built-in webserver.  Using your"
" favourite browser open http://192.168.2.119:8554/download (assuming the "
"gimbal is using the default IP address)."
msgstr ""
"如果云台通过以太网连接，存储在 SD 卡上的图像和视频可通过内置 Web 服务器手动下载。使用常用浏览器访问 "
"http://192.168.2.119:8554/download（假设云台使用默认 IP 地址）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:119
#: 9dff37647fb64225b93d7f0c76e4f105
msgid ""
"`wget <https://www.gnu.org/software/wget/>`__ can also be used to download "
"all images and videos with a single command"
msgstr "`wget <https://www.gnu.org/software/wget/>`__ 也可用于通过单条命令下载所有图像和视频"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:121
#: 07274679badb490a865cac44ea318620
msgid ""
"On Windows, ``wget.exe -r -l 10 --convert-links "
"http://192.168.2.119:8554/download/``"
msgstr ""
"Windows 下：``wget.exe -r -l 10 --convert-links "
"http://192.168.2.119:8554/download/``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-viewpro-gimbal.rst:122
#: 3849def7cba84284a87fff36f424b8dc
msgid ""
"On Linux/Ubuntu ``wget -r -l 10 --convert-links "
"http://192.168.2.119:8554/download/``"
msgstr ""
"Linux/Ubuntu 下：``wget -r -l 10 --convert-links "
"http://192.168.2.119:8554/download/``"
